cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MicroCLIP or MicroPool-2M, please cite this software release. A paper citation will be added after the manuscript is public."
title: "MicroCLIP: Connecting Text and Microscopy Images via Contrastive Language-Image Pretraining"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - microscopy
  - fluorescence microscopy
  - vision-language pretraining
  - contrastive learning
  - zero-shot classification
  - image-text retrieval
authors:
